# Unity3D generated meta files that should not be ignored are handled by
# not ignoring *.meta above (meta files are tracked intentionally)

# Builds
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app

# Crashlytics generated file
crashlytics-build.properties

# Packages (lock file is tracked, but generated package cache is not)
Packages/packages-lock.json.meta

# OS generated
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# Memory captures
[Mm]emoryCaptures/

# Recordings
[Rr]ecordings/

# Editor Rendering artifacts
*.tga.meta

# Addressables
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressables[Aa]ssetsData*.meta
/[Aa]ssets/AddressableAssetsData/*/*.bin*

# Android
*.androidlib

# Sketchfab 공항 에셋 (Free Standard 라이선스: 원본 파일 재배포 금지)
# .meta 파일은 올려서 Scene 연결 ID를 유지한다. docs/lee/README-airport-model.md의 다운로드 안내 참고.
